||service.idsync.analytics.yahoo.com^
||nevoai-iothub-54-prod.azure-devices.net^

! ---- LG telemetry ----
! webOS telemetry collector (pt.elastic.lgwebostv.com in community lists; regional prefixes vary)
||elastic.lgwebostv.com^
||cdpsvc.lgtvcommon.com^
||cdplauncher.lgtvcommon.com^
||rdx2.lgtvsdp.com^
||netflixvoice.lgtvcommon.com^
! CDP beacons: seen blocked on this TV by the HaGeZi LG list only; upstream lists change several
! times a day, so anything we rely on being blocked is also here (2026-10-26)
||cdpbeacon.lgtvcommon.com^
||cdpbeacon2.lgtvcommon.com^

! ---- Device fingerprinting / LAN discovery ----
! Universal Electronics QuickSet: identifies HDMI-connected devices (polled every ~45 s here).
! Cost of blocking: the TV cannot auto-detect/set up other remotes or devices via QuickSet.
||ueiwsp.com^
||quicksetcloud.com^
! Philips Hue bridge discovery (polled ~every 5 min). Cost: Hue sync/control features on the TV.
||meethue.com^

